@startuml
title Activity 13 - Goods Received Note Verification and Discrepancy Loop

|Requester|
start
:Open GRN task from notification;
:Compare delivered items with PO;
:Record received quantity and condition;
|Frontend|
:Validate GRN quantities and status;
if (All goods correct?) then (yes)
  :Submit GRN as RECEIVED;
  |Backend|
  :Persist GRN status = RECEIVED;
  :Update delivery status;
  :Create invoice eligibility;
  :Notify supplier and requester;
  stop
else (no)
  :Enter discrepancy reason and affected items;
  :Submit GRN as DISCREPANCY;
  |Backend|
  :Persist GRN status = DISCREPANCY;
  :Keep unresolved quantities;
  :Notify supplier to resend;
  |Supplier|
  :Open discrepancy details;
  :Create replacement delivery;
  |Backend|
  :Link replacement delivery to same PO/GRN;
  |Requester|
  :Receive replacement shipment;
  :Reopen GRN and verify again;
  if (Correct on retry?) then (yes)
    |Backend|
    :Set GRN status = COMPLETED;
    :Create invoice eligibility;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Repeat discrepancy cycle;
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
